<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to {{clientName}}</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: #f4f4f4;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 20px auto;
        background: white;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b6b 0%, #ee5a52 100%);
        color: white;
        padding: 30px 20px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: 300;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 40px 30px;
      }
      .greeting {
        font-size: 18px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        color: #333;
      }
      .welcome-message {
        background: #ffe8e8;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        border-left: 4px solid #ff6b6b;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .welcome-message h3 {
        margin-top: 0;
        color: #d63031;
        font-size: 20px;
      }
      .invitation-details {
        background: #f8f9fa;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
      }
      .invitation-details h3 {
        margin-top: 0;
        color: #333;
        font-size: 16px;
      }
      .invitation-details p {
        margin: 5px 0;
        color: #666;
      }
      .cta-button {
        display: inline-block;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b6b 0%, #ee5a52 100%);
        color: white;
        padding: 15px 30px;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 50px;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-align: center;
        margin: 20px 0;
        transition: transform 0.2s;
      }
      .cta-button:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }
      .custom-message {
        background: #e3f2fd;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        font-style: italic;
        border-left: 4px solid #2196f3;
      }
      .expiration-info {
        background: #fff3e0;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        border-left: 4px solid #ff9800;
      }
      .features-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
        gap: 15px;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .feature-card {
        background: #f8f9fa;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .feature-card .icon {
        font-size: 32px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      .footer {
        background: #f8f9fa;
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: center;
        color: #666;
        font-size: 14px;
        border-top: 1px solid #dee2e6;
      }
      .footer a {
        color: #ff6b6b;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      @media (max-width: 600px) {
        .container {
          margin: 0;
          border-radius: 0;
        }
        .content {
          padding: 30px 20px;
        }
        .header {
          padding: 20px;
        }
        .header h1 {
          font-size: 24px;
        }
        .features-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>🎊 Welcome!</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <div class="greeting">
          <strong>Hi {{firstName}} {{lastName}},</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="welcome-message">
          <h3>Welcome to {{clientName}}!</h3>
          <p>You've been invited to join our video conferencing platform. Get
            ready for seamless collaboration!</p>
        </div>

        <p>{{inviterName}}
          has set up your account with
          {{clientName}}, where you'll be able to connect with your team through
          high-quality video meetings and collaboration tools.</p>

        <div class="invitation-details">
          <h3>📋 Account Details</h3>
          <p><strong>Invited by:</strong> {{inviterName}} ({{inviterEmail}})</p>
          <p><strong>Organization:</strong> {{clientName}}</p>
          <p><strong>Account email:</strong> {{email}}</p>
          <p><strong>Valid until:</strong>
            {{expiresAt}}
            ({{expirationDays}}
            days remaining)</p>
        </div>

        {{#if customMessage}}
          <div class="custom-message">
            <strong>Welcome Message:</strong><br />
            "{{customMessage}}"
          </div>
        {{/if}}

        <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
          <a href="{{invitationUrl}}" class="cta-button">
            🚀 Activate Your Account
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="expiration-info">
          <strong>⏰ Act Fast:</strong>
          This invitation expires on
          {{expiresAt}}. Activate your account now to secure access!
        </div>

        <h3>🌟 What's Included:</h3>
        <div class="features-grid">
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon">🎥</div>
            <strong>HD Video Calls</strong>
            <p>Crystal-clear video quality</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon">🔊</div>
            <strong>Premium Audio</strong>
            <p>Echo-free conversations</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon">🖥️</div>
            <strong>Screen Sharing</strong>
            <p>Share your screen effortlessly</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon">💬</div>
            <strong>Real-time Chat</strong>
            <p>Text chat during meetings</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon">📱</div>
            <strong>Mobile Ready</strong>
            <p>Works on all devices</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="icon">🔒</div>
            <strong>Secure & Private</strong>
            <p>End-to-end encryption</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p><strong>Next Steps:</strong></p>
        <ol>
          <li>Click the "Activate Your Account" button above</li>
          <li>Create your secure password</li>
          <li>Complete your profile setup</li>
          <li>Start collaborating with your team!</li>
        </ol>

        <p>If you have any questions, feel free to reach out to
          {{inviterName}}
          at
          {{inviterEmail}}.</p>

        <p style="color: #666; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 30px;">
          Can't click the button? Copy and paste this link into your browser:<br
          />
          <a
            href="{{invitationUrl}}"
            style="color: #ff6b6b; word-break: break-all;"
          >{{invitationUrl}}</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>This account invitation was sent by
          {{inviterName}}
          on behalf of
          {{clientName}}.</p>
        <p>If you don't want to join, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>